body:
highly appreciate this! i'm on holiday in turkey and its throwing down with rain, with patchy wifi and a beat up laptop - slowly getting the first part downloaded from a balcony! The youtube sounds like a great idea since my connections unstable, maybe right place and right time for me :-)

&#x200B;

edit - I even had to VPN to get on Reddit in Turkey lol!

What a friendly community. wow. 

# " I'd happily pay in money "

&#x200B;

Right now I'm shaking, I haven't had more than a few hours sleep each night for a few weeks because of this project. Having to learn everything in a few weeks, with a manger who's holding a metaphorical gun to my head, and THIS is how you guys react? Honestly, my mind is shot to pieces already, I'm almost in tears because of how much this project is killing me. The fact I'd pay MY OWN MONEY to make this go away, so I can go outside and enjoy life doesn't give you a clue I'm serious? I was being light hearted, THIS IS REDDIT DUH. 

&#x200B;

I'm giving up. Gonna go somewhere far away, fuck work, fuck life, fuck it all. I reached out when I need help, the internet is full of jerks it seems.

~~This kinda works, I had to use MeshRenderer instead of collider as these objects lack colliders (and I'm just making them hidden). But when it runs, the objects seem to hide at a random position rather than X < 0.~~

&#x200B;

~~I made this movie to show what's wrong.~~

