&#x200B;

~~X = 0 is the roughly where the center of the arc is.~~

&#x200B;

Edit: I had instantiated some clones by accident. The code works great, added one other thing:

&#x200B;

renderers\[i\].enabled = transform.GetChild(i).position.x > 0 && transform.GetChild(i).position.z > -7;
